  "description": "This library provides Hangfire job filters, attributes, and a custom state that allow jobs to\n\t\t\tindicate successful completion with warnings. By decorating job methods with a custom attribute,\n\t\t\tjobs can signal when they have completed but encountered non-fatal issues. The filter detects\n\t\t\tthese warnings and transitions the job to a custom \"succeeded with warning\" state, making it easy\n\t\t\tto distinguish between fully successful jobs and those that require attention. The package is\n\t\t\tdesigned for .NET 8 and integrates seamlessly with Hangfire, enhancing job monitoring and\n\t\t\toperational awareness in enterprise applications.",
  "iconUrl": "https://avatars0.githubusercontent.com/u/16547413",
